## 文件下载处理

### Excel导出

```javascript
// Excel导出处理
exportExcel(params) {
  getExportApi('/api/export/excel', params).then(res => {
    const blob = new Blob([res], { type: 'application/octet-stream' })
    const objectUrl = URL.createObjectURL(blob)
    const suffix = '.xlsx'
    FileSaver.saveAs(objectUrl, '导出数据' + suffix)
  })
}
```

### 文件下载

```javascript
// 通用文件下载
downloadFile(url, fileName) {
  getExportApi(url).then(res => {
    const blob = new Blob([res])
    const objectUrl = URL.createObjectURL(blob)
    FileSaver.saveAs(objectUrl, fileName)
  })
}
```

